consent.\"\n            icon=\"📊\"\n            client:load\n          />\n          <PorscheServiceCard\n            title=\"Digital Freedom\"\n            description=\"Break free from vendor lock-in and choose services that align with your values.\"\n            icon=\"🕊️\"\n            client:load\n          />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"py-12 bg-white\">\n      <div class=\"container mx-auto\">\n        <p-heading tag=\"h2\" size=\"large\" class=\"mb-8 text-center\">Porsche Design System Features</p-heading>\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n          <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border\">\n            <p-heading tag=\"h3\" size=\"medium\" class=\"mb-4\">Consistent Design</p-heading>\n            <p-text>\n              The Porsche Design System provides a comprehensive set of components that ensure\n              consistency across all digital touchpoints while maintaining the brand's premium aesthetic.\n            </p-text>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border\">\n            <p-heading tag=\"h3\" size=\"medium\" class=\"mb-4\">Performance Optimized</p-heading>\n            <p-text>\n              Built with performance in mind, the system includes optimized loading strategies,\n              font preloading, and component chunking for the best user experience.\n            </p-text>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 mt-8 border-t\">\n      <div class=\"container mx-auto text-center text-gray-600\">\n        <p>&copy; 2024 DeGoogle Guide. Take back your privacy.</p>\n        <p-link href=\"/\" variant=\"secondary\" class=\"mt-2\">← Back to Main Site</p-link>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n    <Fragment set:html={getLoaderScript()} />\n  </body>\n</html>"
